      "writtenOn": "2023-01-23T21:40:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah good to know. \nUnfortunately the `install_deps` step fails to update/install `mdbook` (I\u0027m pretty sure that was the package...) because it requires 1.64+ rustc version. So `merge-setup.sh` failed without a change.\n\nIs this something everyone upstream should see with install-deps too?\n\nWhere do I see which version of rust crosvm and android are using now?\n\nI can run `merge-setup.sh ok now that my cloudtop doesn\u0027t need to reinstall `mdbook`, so I could just drop this CL now if we don\u0027t want to change anything here.",
      "parentUuid": "6547b158_6215636b",
      "revId": "b7190d19d70ed7c25c9899fd2f8feeb9ccdd57fd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
